THE JENSEN EXPOSURE, MADE QUANTITATIVE.  Averaging rD over the split ages in a
distance bin is NOT the same as rD at the mean split age.  serial1d d=1 bin:
  rho=    1 : mean of rD over the 9 edges = 0.86205   rD at the mean age = 0.85717   Jensen error -0.57%
  rho=    5 : mean of rD over the 9 edges = 0.67661   rD at the mean age = 0.67751   Jensen error +0.13%
  rho=   20 : mean of rD over the 9 edges = 0.38101   rD at the mean age = 0.38429   Jensen error +0.86%
